    <summary>Organise a big, messy video library offline: find duplicate videos, clean file names and organise folders.</summary>
    <description><![CDATA[SceneSort Pro organises a big, messy media library on your own Windows 10/11 PC.

## Features
- **Finds duplicate videos**, including re-encoded or renamed copies (file size, a content fingerprint and sampled frames). You decide what to keep.
- **Cleans file names** with a side-by-side review before anything changes, with undo.
- **Organises folders** and lets you browse and search the whole library in one place.
- **Offline**: no account, no cloud, full undo.

## Licence
The free edition scans and previews your whole library with no time limit: you see every duplicate and every suggested fix. A one-time Pro licence (US$29, bought at https://scenesortpro.com) applies the fixes and adds Corrupt File Scan and online/AI lookups.

## Notes
- 64-bit Windows 10/11 only.
- The installer is about 297 MB (FFmpeg is included).
]]></description>
    <releaseNotes>1.4.0: Free scans and previews your whole library with no time limit; Pro applies the fixes. Folders are added from Storage → + Add folder. Duplicate Studios/Performers merge with undo. https://scenesortpro.com</releaseNotes>
